  "notes": "Released in three sizes (135M, 360M, 1.7B), each as a base and an Instruct checkpoint. No launch blog post was found. Hub evidence for October 2024: base repositories created on 2024-10-30 and 2024-10-31 (UTC), cards written and first public community discussions on 2024-10-31. Lead only, not a source: an X post by lead author Loubna Ben Allal dated 2024-10-31. The technical report followed on 2025-02-04 (arXiv v1). Context window recorded only for the 1.7B, where the paper states it."
